//
// To run a program, paste it at the end of the `bloom_tests` suite in
// `src/test/bloom_tests.cpp` at the specified revision, include
// `netmessagemaker.h` there, build it with `make -C src test/test_dash` and
// run `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=bloom_tests/<name>`. The output should
// match the section.
